			"langs": [
				"en"
			],
			"text": "v1.135 is live!\n\nYou can now browse quote posts by Top in addition to Latest. And posts keep their thread numbering when quoted.\n\nThese changes are rolling out now. If you don’t see them yet, try refreshing your browser or visiting the app store to make sure you’ve updated to the latest version."
